2026-11-13T05:39:16.8380026Z """Cycle 43363900852: operational resume — predecessor audit failure observed, suite validation failure fixed, snapshot audit-ready.
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8380418Z 
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8380594Z The run resumed the persisted producer snapshot of run ``43357207555`` (team
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8380969Z ref ``4047dfd9``) instead of restarting.  Three things are pinned here:
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8381293Z 
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8381511Z 1. **Why the predecessor stopped before a gate — observed, not inferred.**
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8381879Z    Its team job succeeded and persisted a committed 31-file delta over
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8382227Z    ``origin/lab/product``; its independent-audit job died at step
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8382817Z    ``Independent audit`` after 2705.0 s with the public check-run annotations
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8383189Z    ``LEX_WORK_QUANTUM_EXPIRED seconds=2700`` / ``exit code 78``, so the
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8383562Z    gate-read and audit-persist steps were skipped, no gate exists on any ref
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8383926Z    and the run is UNADJUDICATED.  The job logs corroborate it at
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8384258Z    ``logs_endpoint_status=200``.  Both channels are committed artifacts.
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8384466Z 
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8384622Z 2. **The validation failure this cycle repaired.**  Running the committed
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8385252Z    suite failed with ``assert 43357207555 == 43349050225`` — a stale equality
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8385722Z    pin on the live ``current_cycle_run_id`` pointer in two historical cycle
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8386086Z    tests.  Both now use the POINTER-PIN AMENDMENT (non-regression ``>=``)
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8386481Z    already established by cycle 40272586794, with every posture/report/no-gate
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8386785Z    assertion unchanged.
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8386898Z 
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8387061Z 3. **The lane deliverable still verifies on current bytes** (REPORTED-ONLY):
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8387444Z    the fixed-path content family is clean and the end-to-end offline slice
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8387834Z    still renders a source-linked clickable map plus a sourced answer from the
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8388159Z    cached OpenCaseLaw fixture with no network.
2026-11-13T05:39:16.8388381Z """
