2026-11-13T05:40:43.9199074Z #: by every cycle that re-renders the slice.  They carry the same fixed-path
2026-11-13T05:40:43.9199544Z #: provenance as a flagship bundle, so a provenance-only selector would grow the
2026-11-13T05:40:43.9199939Z #: "fixed-path family" by one 100-decision bundle on every verification cycle
2026-11-13T05:40:43.9200320Z #: and thereby move a previously published family measurement (49 bundles /
