2026-11-13T05:40:43.9201415Z #: end-to-end slice summary; they are simply not members of the frozen
2026-11-13T05:40:43.9201774Z #: flagship family.  This keeps the family definition stable across cycles.
2026-11-13T05:40:43.9202091Z _VERIFY_DIR_RE = re.compile(r"(?:^|/)[^/]*_verify$")
